Package: gsmdolphins
Title: Density Surface Model Abundance Estimation for San Matias Gulf Dolphins
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alejandro", "Buren", , "aburen@conicet.gov.ar",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helper functions and analysis code for estimating the abundance
    and density of common (Delphinus delphis) and dusky (Lagenorhynchus
    obscurus) dolphins in the San Matias Gulf, Argentina, from line-transect
    distance sampling and density surface models. Provides utilities used by
    the analysis pipeline, including lognormal confidence intervals for
    abundance estimates.
